|State ID|State Name       |Description                                                                                                        |Entry Condition                                                             |Exit Condition                                                            |
|--------|-----------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|S-01    |IDLE             |Robot is powered on and waiting; no navigation or delivery activity occurring.                                     |System startup, or warehouse reached after a RETURNING trip.                |A delivery request is received.                                           |
|S-02    |NAVIGATING       |Robot is actively moving toward the destination (or, when re-entered after avoidance, resuming that movement).     |Delivery request received from IDLE, or obstacle successfully avoided.      |Obstacle detected, destination reached, or battery becomes critically low.|
|S-03    |AVOIDING_OBSTACLE|Robot has suspended normal navigation and is executing an obstacle-avoidance maneuver.                             |Obstacle detected while NAVIGATING.                                         |Obstacle successfully avoided, or battery becomes critically low.         |
|S-04    |DELIVERING       |Robot is at the destination and executing the package hand-off/delivery process.                                   |Destination reached while NAVIGATING.                                       |Delivery completed successfully.                                          |
|S-05    |RETURNING        |Robot is traveling back to the warehouse (either after a successful delivery or after aborting due to low battery).|Delivery successful, or critical battery while NAVIGATING/AVOIDING_OBSTACLE.|Warehouse reached.                                                        |
